#39600
Credits Room Reggid Ocean~
This is a connector zone that links to TM Road at 17573 and then over to Plains
Of Xev at 39580..  Its also the way to Atlantis Corwin
~
396 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#39601
The Reggid Ocean~
