The Pebbled Beach~
You wade in from the surf to find yourself on a desrted beach carpeted with
brown and white quartz pebbles.  To the north the beach ends in a sheer wall of
rock that marches straight to the edge of the surf.  The cliffs curve around in
your direction then halt abruptly as though a gap was blasted in the rock
leading inland.    
